<!--Post: 200--><!--Time: 1086393747-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST200"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:webmaster@catchbtk.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Tom_voigt<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Tom_voigt<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, June 04, 2004 - 5:02 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Very odd how the Otero children were killed, but Shirley Vian&#39;s were herded into a bathroom and spared. Coupled with the fact that BTK allegedly interacted in public with one of the Vian children just prior to the attack and you have one interesting enigma.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 200-->
<!--Post: 202--><!--Time: 1086410962-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST202"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Unsub<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Unsub<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, June 04, 2004 - 9:49 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->This has led many to speculate that BTK knew the Oteros and that is why the kids were killed, they were not the primary targets. Also in one of his letters BTK said that Vians children were &#34;saved by a phone call&#34;, which of course means he did intend to kill them but wasnt able to.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 202-->
<!--Post: 204--><!--Time: 1086468931-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST204"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Scbenson2001<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Scbenson2001<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->6-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, June 05, 2004 - 1:55 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->On the ezboard a person posted part of the vian letter from BTK as saying &#34;They were very lucky; a phone call saved them. I was going to tape the boys and put plastic bags over thier head like I did joseph, and shirley. And then hang the girl. God-oh god what a beautiful sexual relief this would been&#34; This posting however was from &#34;goldenboy&#34; who I see Tom has warned not to trust, so take it for what its worth. The rest of the posting consists of all btk letter segments that have been released and it seems accurate.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 204-->
<!--Post: 205--><!--Time: 1086474296-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST205"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Lilahsue<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lilahsue<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, June 05, 2004 - 3:24 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I do believe that part of the btk letter is accurate.  I&#39;m sure I&#39;ve read it somewhere in an article, just just from a website.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 205-->
<!--Post: 206--><!--Time: 1086475649-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST206"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Laoise<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Laoise<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, June 05, 2004 - 3:47 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->It is accurate... there are bits and pieces of the letters strewn throughout the net.  <BR>My take on his comment tho...i think he was just saving face...he never had any intention of killing the Vian kids but hey...he&#39;s a scary serial killer!  he cant be leaving potential victims walking around because he&#39;s &#42;gasps&#42; compassionate!<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 206-->
<!--Post: 207--><!--Time: 1086479297-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST207"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Scbenson2001<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Scbenson2001<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->6-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, June 05, 2004 - 4:48 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I don&#39;t believe that he spared them. I think he left for some reason. Ms. Vian or the kids might have been screaming, then there was a phone call and it spooked him. Thinking it was a response to the noise, he left. Why would he want to leave witnesses? Especially when he knew he had talked to one of the children outside the house. We wouldn&#39;t know about him showing the kid the photo. I&#39;m sure BTK would rather the police not have that info<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 207-->
<!--Post: 214--><!--Time: 1086516092-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST214"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Laoise<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Laoise<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, June 06, 2004 - 3:01 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Ah but how easy would it have been to walk into the bathroom &#40;i think thats where they were&#41; and stab them each and leave no witnesses at all?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 214-->
<!--Post: 217--><!--Time: 1086555629-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST217"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Scbenson2001<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Scbenson2001<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->6-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, June 06, 2004 - 2:00 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Laoise,  <BR>   Why then, as tom asks did he have no problem killing the otero children, but suddenly developed a conscious during the Vian murder.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 217-->
<!--Post: 218--><!--Time: 1086562786-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST218"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Laoise<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Laoise<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, June 06, 2004 - 3:59 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I have a theory on this... Im not sure this is the place to put it tho. If not, Im sure Tom will correct me. Anyway, I was bothered for the longest time that he seemed to wait until after the older Otero kids had left for school... why? I believe its because, in his own family, there were no kids older then Josephine. I believe he was symbolically killing his own family, including himself, when he killed the Oteros. Joseph Jr was himself. That would also fit as to why he...checked in...with one of the Vian kids before he killed that day... he was checking to make sure he wasnt going to have some kind of emotional setback and have to kill the Vian boy who was around the age of Joseph...  am i making sense?  Gods Im tired right now...  I can explain better after sleep if need be...<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 218-->
<!--Post: 219--><!--Time: 1086568875-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST219"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Scbenson2001<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Scbenson2001<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->6-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, June 06, 2004 - 5:41 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->That doesn&#39;t make sense to me. BTK had no way of knowing the two younger kids were not going to school. They only stayed home because they were sick. There&#39;s not a chance he could have predicted if they would be there, one way or the other. It was strictly chance. I think the mother was the attended target. He watched the house. He knew the husband took the kids to school, and what <BR>time he did it. He waited for him to leave. Then entered the house. Mr. Otero came back for one reason or another and then he was killed. I think the little girl ended up in the basement because she was hiding there.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 219-->
<!--Post: 221--><!--Time: 1086577193-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST221"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Laoise<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Laoise<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, June 06, 2004 - 7:59 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->This man has shown the utmost in patience and could certainly have been watching the family waiting... hoping... for just the right time to fulfill his fantasy. <BR> <BR>&#34;A late bulletin from police Wednesday said a white male, about 5-feet-10 to 6 feet, slender build, wearing a dark topcoat or trenchcoat with dark shaggy hair cut below his ears, was observed in front of the Otero residence at 8:45 a.m. Tuesday.&#34; <BR> <BR>That would be time enough to realize the younger kids werent going to school that day since they didnt have to be to school until 9am and its quite possible that he was watching the house and saw that the younger kids didnt leave that morning with the older ones. <BR> <BR>&#34;The time of Otero&#39;s death was set between 8:15 and 8:45 am. All four family members were dead before 9 a.m., Hannon said.&#34; <BR> <BR>Plenty of time for mr otero to have made it back home. <BR> <BR>All quotes were taken from the Jan 17, 1974 article entitled &#34;Police baffled on motive in mass killing&#34;<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 221-->
<!--Post: 263--><!--Time: 1086972257-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST263"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Jenkins<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Jenkins<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->6-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, June 11, 2004 - 9:44 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I agree with the profile at courttv.com, the one that said that Josephine was the target. <BR> <BR>I mean she is clearly set apart. Why would her death be so different from the rest of the family&#39;s? Why would he go through so much special work just for her? Just because she was hiding? I don&#39;t know about that. <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 263-->
<!--Post: 1215--><!--Time: 1097778861-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST1215"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Nostone<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Nostone<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, October 14, 2004 - 11:34 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->SCBenson&#39;s 6/25 post makes a lot of sense to me.  He may not have finished because there was screaming and THEN the phone rang.  He may have just calmly left the scene knowing that Vian&#39;s kids were too young to really be of any help to the investigators. <BR> <BR>As far as the last post about Josephine Otero being the real target, she may not have originally been the intended target, but maybe once BTK saw her, she became his target.  Mrs Otero may have fought back too much &#40;seems very likely since her cheek bone was supposedly broken and her fingernails were ruined&#41; and he knew he&#39;d have an easier time with the young girl.  <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 1215-->
<!--Post: 1786--><!--Time: 1102861880-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST1786"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Kruimel<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Kruimel<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, December 12, 2004 - 6:31 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Just thinking out loud! &#40;speculation&#41; <BR> <BR>What did BTK have to do with possibly older picture of Vian&#43; child and a picture of the child. <BR>Vian was divorced and is the child from her ex?  <BR>Can her ex confirm if this is his child? <BR> <BR>Why did she divorce her ex? Had the ex been in war/militairy duty?&#40;sometimes reason for break-ups&#41; and was the divorce during that time &#40;militairy&#41; or after? <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 1786-->
<!--Post: 2689--><!--Time: 1103924458-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST2689"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Vdubguy<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Vdubguy<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, December 24, 2004 - 1:40 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->One thing Ive heard several places, &#39;Dont fraternize with your enemy&#39; ...Its difficult to kill some one you know or have socialized with. Makes me wonder if he DIDNT know the Otero kids but possibly did know the Vian kids...Maybe he dated her at one point.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 2689-->
<!--Post: 2692--><!--Time: 1103927150-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST2692"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Q<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Q<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, December 24, 2004 - 2:25 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Actually most murder victims are killed by someone they know or have met, I believe. <BR> <BR>&#34;Don&#39;t fraternize with your enemy&#34; is speaking of a pre knowledge that someone or something is an enemy. <BR> <BR>In a twisted sort of way, many here are doing just that if BTK is the enemy. <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 2692-->
<!--Post: 2696--><!--Time: 1103951113-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST2696"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Vdubguy<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Vdubguy<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, December 24, 2004 - 9:05 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->True...most victims are killed by an acquaintence, depending on how you define the word &#39;know&#39;, I should have stated that there may have been some &#39;familiarity&#39; between BTK and the kids...<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 2696-->
<!--Post: 2887--><!--Time: 1104233570-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST2887"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Flaco<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Flaco<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, December 28, 2004 - 3:32 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Since one of Vian&#39;s oldest children is now 35 or so, has there been any news from/about them?  I&#39;m curious as to how this has affected them.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 2887-->
<!--Post: 4129--><!--Time: 1105716740-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4129"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Cricket<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Cricket<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, January 14, 2005 - 7:32 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->To Kruimel&#39;s post 12/12/04 <BR> <BR>I read in one of the KAKE news reports that BTK showed a picture of a Lady and child, but it was not a picture of Shirley Vain and one of her kids.  I tried to find where I read that and can&#39;t though.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 4129-->
<!--Post: 4133--><!--Time: 1105728179-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4133"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Freya<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Freya<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, January 14, 2005 - 10:42 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I re-read Douglas&#39;s profile of BaTiK recently and one thing really stood out for me: Joseph Otero&#39;s head was covered with three &#34;hoods&#34;, as if to suggest that he had been suffocated, but there were marks on his neck showing the signature strangulation. Douglas believed that this was a sign that the killer was uncomfortable with this murder, unlike the rest. I don&#39;t believe that he necessarily &#34;spared&#34; the Vian children, but for some reason my gut tells me that received next to no satisfaction by killing anyone who wasn&#39;t: 1&#41; an adult male or female OR 2&#41; a female child old enough to satisfy whatever &#34;sexual&#34; reason he committed the murders. In short, I think that he wanted to put off the murders of the Vian children until absolutely last, and took advantage of any reason to cut the enterprise short.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 4133-->
<!--Post: 4144--><!--Time: 1105748499-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4144"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Elsbarn<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Elsbarn<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, January 14, 2005 - 4:21 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Yes, it strikes me that three of the five incidences involved mothers with children present. These are also, from what I can tell, the incidences where there was no forced entry.  <BR> <BR>It could be he wanted the children there to make sure that he had another method to control the primary target, the mothers. It might also be that terrorized children add to his drive. I do agree with John Douglas&#39;s assessment: something bothered BTK about killing the boy and it may have been his own aversion to the notion of homosexual pedophilia. Why not just kill the boy &#40;like he attempted to do with Kevin Bright&#41; without going through the signature strangulation, which from what I can tell, is tying the victims in such a fashion that they can&#39;t help from strangling themselves while BTK watches and masturbates? <BR> <BR>I came to the realization of what he actually does not long age. I had been reading these boards way too much, and then read the article in the Eagle regarding the retired detective speaking on Shirley Vian, and while falling asleep one night, the image of him sitting back and watching visualized to me. It made me nauseous. It was the first time I ever considered the death penalty the only viable consequence. <BR> <BR>Are there any other serial killers that have conducted their crimes with so many children present? I just can&#39;t help but think there is something more to this angle. <BR> <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 4144-->
<!--Post: 4145--><!--Time: 1105749375-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4145"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Elsbarn<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Elsbarn<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, January 14, 2005 - 4:36 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I mean besides those serial killers who were known to outright target children, like Wayne Williams.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 4145-->
<!--Post: 4203--><!--Time: 1105849913-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4203"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Boffa994<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Boffa994<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, January 15, 2005 - 8:31 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->It is pretty weird that Btk would  kill the Otero children , but leave the Vian children untouched. <BR>Were the Otero children much  older and could have had a better shot at identiying  him or maybe he didnt expect the Otero children to be home and they knew him personally as a friend of the family or an aquantince. After all the first victims of a serial killer is usaully someone they knew or had contact with. Or just another thought Btk was rumored to be a young male at the time of the Otero murders. The Vian murder was a couple of years later. Maybe he eventually had a child of his own with in those next couple of years and as a father couldnt bare to hurt the Vian children physically after that now that he knew what it was like to have a child of his own. Just a thought, but BTk being able to give mercy. Probably seriuosly doubt that.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 4203-->
<!--Post: 4210--><!--Time: 1105883474-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4210"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Essevi<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Essevi<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, January 16, 2005 - 5:51 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I think he planned on killing the Vian children but they escaped through the bathroom window. In one of his letters he states--&#34;phone call saved them&#34;. The question is...why did he not cut the phone line?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 4210-->
<!--Post: 4216--><!--Time: 1105896284-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4216"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Freya<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Freya<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, January 16, 2005 - 9:24 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->See, I guess I just don&#39;t believe him when he wrote, &#34;Phone call saved them&#34; and something about how he would have enjoyed hurting the little girl. He was waaay too controlled of the situations for such a thing as a phone call to scare him away. So I think that&#39;s baloney &#40;my technical word for it :-&#41;. And I honestly think killing very young girls was harder for him to sexualize, and he didn&#39;t really want to kill the little boy, so he just decided against it. I&#39;m not in anyway trying to suggest &#34;mercy&#34; or &#34;compassion&#34;--I just think that he would only kill if he had something to gain from it &#40;e.g., eliminating a witness who could identify, sexual gratification, anger, etc.&#41; I don&#39;t think that the Vian children fell into any of those categories. I absolutely do not believe that a &#34;phone call saved them.&#34; Think of Josephine Otero &#40;the daughter&#41;. She still had her shirt on when the police found her. I think he had a harder time sexualizing the death of a little girl as opposed to an older woman. He may say otherwise, and I just don&#39;t believe him. I think he would say so because pedophilia is even more horrifying in our society than raping and killing an adult woman. Anyone disagree? <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 4216-->
<!--Post: 4226--><!--Time: 1105913237-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4226"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Oklahoma_mike<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Oklahoma_mike<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->11-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, January 16, 2005 - 2:07 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Believe it or not &#39;compassion&#39;, if one can use the term, in serial killers is not totally unknown.  Profiler John Douglas describes in one of his books how a killer forced his way into a car with a gun intending to kidnap and kill the young woman driving.  But when she started begging not to hurt her baby asleep in the back he let them go.  Upon capture he said that much as he wanted to kill the woman he was not a child killer.  Very rare, but it seems it did happen. <BR>I suspect one or both of the Otero kids knew him and that is why he had to kill them.  I think his sexual activity with young Josephine was not planned, just taking advantage of the situation, and that she was just barely old enough for him to look at her in a sexual way.  It was probably less gratifying for him than an adult victim thus he never repeated.  He later only killed young adult women.  Had he wanted to target young girls, he could have, as so many other killers have.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 4226-->
<!--Post: 5864--><!--Time: 1107428159-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5864"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Openeyes<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Openeyes<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 03, 2005 - 2:55 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I do not believe he ever intended too kill Vians children, one of btk&#39;s signature trademarks is to cut the phoneline of his victims, and he mentions this is one of his letters. As to why he says a phone call had saved the children, I believe is because he wanted to make himself seem capable of killing children so he could take credit for the Otero children. In my opinion BTK was not the killer of the Oteros children, he either had an accomplice, or was someone on the crime scene that knew the details then went on to copy them in other murders. <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5864-->
<!--Post: 5874--><!--Time: 1107439310-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5874"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Kansasgirl<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Kansasgirl<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 03, 2005 - 6:01 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Tonight on KAKE there is going to be an interview with one of the Vian children. He would have been five at the time of the murder. It will be interesting to see what a five-year-old remembers. I don&#39;t remember much from when I was five, however, I didn&#39;t suffer such a tramatic experience.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5874-->
<!--Post: 5879--><!--Time: 1107440342-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5879"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Kansasgirl<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Kansasgirl<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 03, 2005 - 6:19 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->This is an exert from tonights interview <BR> <BR><a href="http://www.kansas.com/mld/kansas/news/special_packages/btk/10803192.htm" target=_top>http://www.kansas.com/mld/kansas/news/special_pack ages/btk/10803192.htm</a><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5879-->
<!--Post: 5895--><!--Time: 1107448022-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5895"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Teardrop<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Teardrop<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->7-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 03, 2005 - 8:27 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Openeyes: I believe that you are right in that he did not intend to kill the Vian children. I think that the only reason he killed the Otero children is because they were old enough to idenify him. I think that he knew Joe Otero or of him from some place in time or through someone else. BTK was intending to settle a score. Josephine&#39;s budding womanhood inflamed his bloodlust. <BR> <BR>When the Vian boy started to cry, it plucked at a heartstring.  . <BR> <BR> <BR> <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5895-->
<!--Post: 5903--><!--Time: 1107450749-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5903"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Bookworm<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Bookworm<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 03, 2005 - 9:12 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->This could be coincidental but there were three children not killed in both the Otero and Vian cases.  <BR> <BR>Another connection is the three stars that make up Orion&#39;s belt &#40;constellation&#41;make up numbers in Shirley&#39;s address 1311. They are Alnitak &#40;means &#34;the girdle&#34;&#41;, Alnilam &#40;means &#34;the string of pearls&#34;&#41;, and Mintaka &#40;means &#34;the belt&#34;&#41;. Joe Ortero was strangled with a belt. They are looking for Nancy Fox&#39;s pearl necklace.  <BR> <BR>The initals of the stars descending from the highest point are M=13 A=1 A=1, 1311, which is Shirley&#39;s address on Hydraulic. <BR> <BR>Constellation link: <BR><a href="http://www.glyphweb.com/esky/default.htm?http://www.glyphweb.com/esky/constellations/orionsbelt.html" target=_top>http://www.glyphweb.com/esky/default.htm?http://ww w.glyphweb.com/esky/constellations/orionsbelt.html</a><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5903-->
<!--Post: 5905--><!--Time: 1107451624-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5905"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Screamer<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Screamer<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->6-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 03, 2005 - 9:27 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Out of this artical I see &#34;well dressed man with a briefcase&#34;. I haven&#39;t heard that before. Is this something new to just me? <BR> <BR>Someone please post the interview after it airs for the out of towners. <BR> <BR>Thanks.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5905-->
<!--Post: 5908--><!--Time: 1107452415-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5908"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Essevi<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Essevi<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 03, 2005 - 9:40 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Bookworm- Great research!  <BR> <BR>Do you really think that BTK could possibly be that smart? He would have to do tons of studying and remember- no internet back then. It&#39;s a great theory and the numbers work, but I doubt that BTK could be this sophisticated.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5908-->
<!--Post: 5912--><!--Time: 1107454225-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5912"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Iceteajan<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Iceteajan<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 03, 2005 - 10:10 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Part of this message is also posted in another thread because I think it truly ties in to both subjects. <BR> <BR>The newest article Tom just posted on the Vain murders states that the mother was ill in bed.  <BR> <BR>Wasn&#39;t someone in the Otero family ill the day of the murders also? <BR> <BR>Who would have information about the children or family members being ill, or not being able to show up at school, work, etc? <BR> <BR>Someone at school or work who handles/posts the absentee records?   <BR> <BR>Someone who works at a drug store or handles drug deliveries? <BR> <BR>Someone who works at a doctor&#39;s office? <BR> <BR>On the day of the Vain murders -- why were the children at home?  Was it a school day and their mother couldn&#39;t bring them to school? Or was it summer break and the kids were off?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5912-->
<!--Post: 5914--><!--Time: 1107455291-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5914"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Lorenap<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lorenap<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 03, 2005 - 10:28 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Iceteajan: The middle of March is usually spring break.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5914-->
<!--Post: 6045--><!--Time: 1107491563-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6045"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Kansasgirl<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Kansasgirl<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 03, 2005 - 8:32 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->They didn&#39;t release much new information tonight on KAKE. There will be another part of the interview Friday evening. The son stated that he watched the murder occur over the bathroom door. BTK had Shirley put toys, blankets and the kids into the bathroom. He tied the door shut with a rope and pushed a bed in front of the door. The older brother tried to get out through the bathroom window and they could not get out. The son that was interviewed &#40;5-years-old at the time&#41; managed to get the door open. The mom had her hands tied behind her back with tape, a plastic bag over head and a rope around her neck. He tried to get the rope off of her neck and was unsuccessful. He ran to the neighbors house to have them call the police. BTK was approximately in the house 40 minutes. That was the extent of the interview.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6045-->
<!--Post: 6072--><!--Time: 1107525193-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6072"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Beck<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Beck<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, February 04, 2005 - 5:53 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I just looked at what they had on KAKE&#39;s website. Apparently there is more on tonight.  <BR> <BR>&#34;On Friday at 10, Relford talks about new clues, which he feels, could lead to BTK, including that infamous picture BTK showed Relford 15 minutes before BTK killed his mother.&#34; <BR> <BR> <BR><a href="http://www.kake.com/home/headlines/1228902.html" target=_top>http://www.kake.com/home/headlines/1228902.html</a><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6072-->
<!--Post: 6077--><!--Time: 1107527439-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6077"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Topsailgrl<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Topsailgrl<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, February 04, 2005 - 6:30 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->What I want to know is: Is KAKE doing this for ratings? What <b>is</b> KAKE&#39;s purpose in the interview? Seriously.  <BR> <BR>This guy needs help. Is KAKE going to exploit him or use him and then let him flap in the wind? This is going to open the door for more media, and curiosity seekers. Is he going to be able to handle that?  <BR> <BR>Did anyone notice the particle board walls? He obviously is living by simple means. He obviously has had serious problems because of the trauma. Back in the 70&#39;s, his Grandparents most likely would not have known about the right kind of counseling for children, or may not have been able to afford it. They probably did the best that they could. <BR> <BR>I guess what I really want to know is KAKE going to get this guy the help he needs or just let him handle what this is going to bring all on his own? It really kind of pisses me off. I really felt for this guy.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6077-->
<!--Post: 6102--><!--Time: 1107533992-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6102"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Redhead<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Redhead<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, February 04, 2005 - 8:19 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I live in the south, and I may be behind a bit. <BR>Could someone explain the meaning of &#34;Satin Sheets&#34; to me?  Thanks.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6102-->
<!--Post: 6109--><!--Time: 1107535421-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6109"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Lorenap<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lorenap<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, February 04, 2005 - 8:43 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->&#34;Satin Sheets&#34; is the song Shirley Vian used to sing to her son Steve when he couldn&#39;t sleep. He shared that with Susan Peters in his interview with her. <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6109-->
<!--Post: 6353--><!--Time: 1107720213-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6353"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Bookworm<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Bookworm<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, February 06, 2005 - 12:03 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Essevi,  <BR>If BTK is copycating Zodiac, he may have done this research. I had found an Orion constellation in the 340 cipher &#40;it&#39;s in the archives&#41;. <BR> <BR>Iceteajan and Lorenap, Easter Sunday that year was April 10th. <BR> <BR><a href="http://www.smart.net/mmontes-cgi-bin/cal-form.cgi" target=_top>http://www.smart.net/mmontes-cgi-bin/cal-form.cgi</a><!--/Text--></td></tr>
